      "instance_name": "historical_event",
      "label": "History of Slavery in the United States",
      "description": "The historical context of slavery in the United States, including the enslavement of Black people and the subsequent creation of Confederate flags and statues as symbols of that history. This context is necessary to understand the reference to 'flags and statues that remind you of the history of slavery' and the implication that Black people were 'around during slavery'.",
