      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "confederate_symbols",
      "label": "Confederate Flags and Statues",
      "description": "Symbols such as Confederate flags and statues that are associated with the history of slavery and racism in the United States. These symbols are often the target of debates about historical memory and racial justice. The meme references these symbols as objects to be removed, which is a key part of its message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
