      "label": "Tribeca Film Festival",
      "description": "An annual film festival held in New York City, which is a real-world event. The backdrop in the image features logos for the Tribeca Film Festival, which provides context for the setting of the photo. The use of this event as a backdrop is likely intended to add a veneer of legitimacy or cultural relevance to the meme, which is a common tactic in online hate speech.",
